{"id": "gsm8k_train_05091", "action": "T", "latency_ms": 6168.907068902627, "raw_answer": "To determine the total number of frosting cans Paul needs, we calculate the frosting required for each type of baked good based on the given rates:\n\n- For 3 layer cakes: Each requires 1 can, so $3 \\times 1 = 3$ cans.\n- For 6 dozen cupcakes: Each dozen requires 0.5 cans, so $6 \\times 0.5 = 3$ cans.\n- For 12 single cakes: Each requires 0.5 cans, so $12 \\times 0.5 = 6$ cans.\n- For 18 pans of brownies: Each requires 0.5 cans, so $18 \\times 0.5 = 9$ cans.\n\nAdding these together: $3 + 3 + 6 + 9 = 21$ cans.\n\nThe answer is 21.", "generated_token_ids": [1249, 8253, 279, 2790, 1372, 315, 98181, 42632, 6898, 3880, 11, 582, 11047, 279, 98181, 2567, 369, 1817, 943, 315, 40678, 1661, 3118, 389, 279, 2661, 7813, 1447, 12, 1752, 220, 18, 6193, 47569, 25, 8886, 7460, 220, 16, 646, 11, 773, 400, 18, 1124, 15136, 220, 16, 284, 220, 18, 3, 42632, 624, 12, 1752, 220, 21, 20403, 87893, 25, 8886, 20403, 7460, 220, 15, 13, 20, 42632, 11, 773, 400, 21, 1124, 15136, 220, 15, 13, 20, 284, 220, 18, 3, 42632, 624, 12, 1752, 220, 16, 17, 3175, 47569, 25, 8886, 7460, 220, 15, 13, 20, 42632, 11, 773, 400, 16, 17, 1124, 15136, 220, 15, 13, 20, 284, 220, 21, 3, 42632, 624, 12, 1752, 220, 16, 23, 63783, 315, 13876, 550, 25, 8886, 7460, 220, 15, 13, 20, 42632, 11, 773, 400, 16, 23, 1124, 15136, 220, 15, 13, 20, 284, 220, 24, 3, 42632, 382, 32308, 1493, 3786, 25, 400, 18, 488, 220, 18, 488, 220, 21, 488, 220, 24, 284, 220, 17, 16, 3, 42632, 382, 785, 4226, 374, 220, 17, 16, 13, 151645], "n_gen_tokens": 181, "receiver_input_tokens": 296, "helper_message": "The essential background knowledge needed to answer the question is the frosting usage rates for different quantities of baked goods.", "helper_input_tokens": 146, "n_helper_tokens": 22, "answer": "21", "invalid": false, "extract_route": "after_last_answer_is", "gold_read": false}
